[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0000","text":"化妆师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0010","text":"现在给您上腮红哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0020","text":"好的，拜托了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0030","text":"噗噗噗……地……\n“恋爱了！”这种感觉的，玫瑰色的脸颊吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0040","text":"我去买点喝的\n大家如果有什么想要的也可以说……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0050","text":"（……大家托付的份，全都买到了，太好了……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0060","text":"……────而已的话题……\n圆香酱，恋爱的话会变成什么样呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0070","text":"诶……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0080","text":"（……！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0090","text":"这个嘛……\n会怎么样呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22100600_02_0100","text":"保密"}]
